Usphere — unofficial port of Lithosphere for Minecraft 26.3
============================================================

"Usphere" is the distribution name of this repository. The datapack
contained here is a compatibility port of:

    Lithosphere 1.8.2 by Jayzet
    https://modrinth.com/datapack/lithosphere
    https://modrinth.com/user/Jayzet

The original project is licensed "All Rights Reserved". No license
from the original author is claimed or implied by this port. All
credit, rights and ownership of the Lithosphere world-generation
design remain with Jayzet.

This repository hosts only the format migration required to run the
pack on Minecraft 26.3 ("Wilderness Bound"), plus verification
artifacts, and is provided for community convenience. The migration
tooling is open for review under the repository's terms.

If you are the author and object to this repository, open an issue
and it will be taken down or restricted.
